        "title": "A Deeply Spiritual Experience at Pashupatinath Temple",
        "text": "Visiting Pashupatinath Temple was a powerful and moving experience. The ancient architecture, spiritual atmosphere, and rituals by the Bagmati River left a lasting impression. Watching the harmony of life and death—pilgrims praying just steps away from cremation ceremonies—was both humbling and eye-opening.\n\nThe temple complex is rich in culture and history, with sadhus adding a mystical charm. I recommend visiting early in the morning for a more peaceful experience. It’s a must-visit for anyone interested in spirituality, culture, or simply seeking a deeper travel experience",
